      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/gu-win/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Route 43 runs through Gu-Win, heading 3 miles northwest to Guin and 3 miles southeast to Winfield.",
